  "changes": [
    "Capture per-layer SVG nodes while building the SVG; set initial visibility once, then update only changed layers while preserving explicit entity invisibility.",
    "Use an internal per-load AbortController, discard late source/resolver results and errors, and stop obsolete source fetches. Pre-aborted sources are rejected before reads.",
    "Replace per-byte Base64 construction with owned Blob URLs for binary raster resources, preserving view offsets and byte snapshots. This also fixes binary resolver results displaying placeholders.",
    "Track only session-created image URLs and release them on replacement, abort, current failure or destruction; caller-owned string URLs remain untouched.",
    "Decode base64 DXF data URLs as UTF-8 and clear prior drawing/layer/pan state before a new file; destruction clears listeners and object references."
  ],
