  "limits": [
    "Same-engine old/new engineering comparison. Generated layered drawings and PNGs, plus one bundled small DXF; no frontend peer/SOTA ranking or general DXF speed claim.",
    "loadMs stops at parsed/resolved SVG DOM completion. Layer timings cover synchronous visibility changes, excluding layout, paint, image decode readiness, file I/O and module loading.",
    "Baseline byte-array/slice images do not render, so their timings cannot support a speed ratio. Blob and real drawing controls are below 10 ms and receive no optimization claim.",
    "The layer cache retains references to the current drawing nodes until replacement or destruction; no peak-memory reduction is claimed.",
    "Already-started synchronous parsing and custom resolver tasks may finish before their result is discarded. No worker interruption or resolver-level network cancellation API is added.",
    "Existing limits for DXF entities, patterned hatches, SHX, advanced text and layout/xrefs remain. This round adds no new native CAD format."
  ],
